OL,3,GNEWSABanks still refusing credit cards,
OL,4,Awatchdog says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslanders are still struggling to get
OL,7,Fcredit cards despite personal data
OL,8,Fchanges to make it easier to apply for
OL,9,Fone, a consumer council has said.
OL,11,FThe changes which came into force on 30
OL,12,FJuly meant the government could
OL,13,Fsecurely share personal data with UK
OL,14,Fcredit reference agencies, which had
OL,15,Fbeen seen as the main barrier to
OL,16,Fsuccessful applications.
OL,18,FHowever, the Jersey Consumer Council
OL,19,Fsaid several providers had still
OL,20,Frefused applications and called for the
OL,21,Fgovernment to work closer with
OL,22,Fbusinesses and banks.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
