OL,3,GNEWSABanks still refusing credit cards,
OL,4,Awatchdog says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Jersey's government
OL,7,Fsaid it had "engaged with providers
OL,8,Fthroughout this process" and whether
OL,9,Fproducts were offered in the island
OL,10,F"remains a commercial decision".
